Package: ggcircos
Title: Circular Layouts and Chord Diagrams for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Shuangbin",
           family = "Xu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "xshuangbin@163.com",
           comment = c(ORCID="0000-0003-3513-5362"))
Description: Build chord diagrams, circular tracks and genome-scale link
    maps with the grammar of graphics. The layout — node arcs, sectors and
    the angular slot reserved for every link — is computed once and kept as
    data, so every layer is an ordinary 'ggplot2' layer and scales, facets
    and themes work as usual.
